==Battleground==
*10 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Luke (Enemy)|Luke]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Capy]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**20 [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

